{
  "date": "2026-11-06",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "12月1日起，微信支付限制个体工商户新建预充值优惠",
  "title_en": "From December 1, WeChat Pay Limits Sole Proprietors from Creating New Prepaid Offers",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "财付通支付科技公司在11月3日发了一份通知。通知说，为了管理业务风险，微信支付要对个体工商户的商户号做一些调整，涉及部分营销功能。",
      "en": "Tenpay Payment Technology Co. issued a notice on November 3. The notice said that, in order to manage business risk, WeChat Pay will make some adjustments to the merchant accounts of sole proprietors, involving some marketing features."
    },
    {
      "zh": "这些是预充值类产品，包括预充值代金券、预充值立减和银行营销活动。调整从12月1日零点开始，只对自己创建批次的个体工商户商户号有效。",
      "en": "These are prepaid-type products, including prepaid vouchers, prepaid instant discounts and bank marketing campaigns. The change starts at 00:00 on December 1 and applies only to sole-proprietor merchant accounts that create the batches themselves."
    },
    {
      "zh": "12月1日以后，商户不能再新开通这几种产品，也不能创建新的批次。12月1日以前已经创建、但还没有启用的批次，之后也不能启用。",
      "en": "After December 1, merchants cannot newly activate these products or create new batches. Batches created before December 1 but not yet enabled cannot be enabled afterwards either."
    },
    {
      "zh": "不受影响的有这些：12月1日以前已经创建并启用的批次，可以继续发放到过期；用户已经领取的优惠，也可以用到过期。免充值的批次仍然可以创建，个体工商户作为核销方，也可以继续接受第三方创建的活动。",
      "en": "Not affected are these: batches already created and enabled before December 1 can continue to be issued until they expire; offers users have already claimed can also be used until they expire. No-top-up batches can still be created, and sole proprietors acting as the redeeming party can continue to accept campaigns created by third parties."
    }
  ],
  "source": {
    "name": "移动支付网",
    "name_en": "Mpaypass (China Mobile Payment Network)",
    "url": "https://www.mpaypass.com.cn/news/202611/05174547.html"
